{"questions":[{"id":"Q109","typeId":"分批搬運","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S13:p1"],"prompt":"兩台搬運機各搬同樣多箱，第一台每趟3箱、第二台每趟7箱，第一台比第二台多16趟。兩台合計搬幾箱？","answer":"168","explanation":"x/3−x/7＝16，x＝84，各84箱，合計168。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"x/3-x/7=16","root":"84","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c1","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"168"},{"id":"c2","text":"67.2","misconception":"把兩台趟數相減誤列成相加，錯用x/3+x/7＝16；題意是相差16趟。"},{"id":"c3","text":"84","misconception":"這是單台搬運機搬的箱數；兩台合計應再乘2。"},{"id":"c4","text":"48","misconception":"把每趟箱數與多16趟直接相乘，漏掉第二台也在搬運。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q110","typeId":"順次取剩餘","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S11:p2","S13:p1","S15:p2"],"prompt":"補給箱先取出1/4，再取剩下的1/3，最後取當時剩下的2/5，箱內尚有18件。最初有幾件？","answer":"60","explanation":"x×3/4×2/3×3/5＝18，得x＝60。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"x*(3/4)*(2/3)*(3/5)=18","root":"60","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c2","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"1080","misconception":"將三次取出的比例直接相加；後兩次的基準都是當時剩餘量。"},{"id":"c2","text":"60"},{"id":"c3","text":"30","misconception":"只反推最後取走2/5這一步；還須反推前兩次取出。"},{"id":"c4","text":"90","misconception":"把最後剩餘比率3/5錯用成取出比率2/5，應連乘剩餘比例。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q112","typeId":"各占總量","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S12:p3"],"prompt":"景然三天分別完成總計畫的1/6、1/3、1/4，尚有15頁未完成。整份計畫幾頁？","answer":"60","explanation":"剩下1−1/6−1/3−1/4＝1/4，所以總共60頁。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"x*(1-1/6-1/3-1/4)=15","root":"60","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c4","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"20","misconception":"以已完成3/4去除剩下15頁；15頁應對應未完成1/4。"},{"id":"c2","text":"30","misconception":"只扣除1/6與1/3，漏掉第三天已完成的1/4。"},{"id":"c3","text":"45","misconception":"把總計畫的3/4已完成頁數當成總頁數，尚須加剩下15頁。"},{"id":"c4","text":"60"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q117","typeId":"折扣與預算","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S10:p1","S14:p2"],"prompt":"亦辰購買平板，原價比預算多800元；打七五折後，比預算少400元。他的預算是多少元？","answer":"4000","explanation":"0.75(x+800)＝x−400，得x＝4000。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"0.75*(x+800)=x-400","root":"4000","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c1","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"4000"},{"id":"c2","text":"3600","misconception":"這是打折後的售價；預算比這個金額多400元。"},{"id":"c3","text":"4800","misconception":"這是平板原價；題目問預算，應減掉超出的800元。"},{"id":"c4","text":"2400","misconception":"只用800元作折扣差，得到原價3200再減800；漏掉折後還少400元。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q118","typeId":"折扣與半價","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S02:p3","S10:p1"],"prompt":"一款頭燈打七折後，比原定價的一半多64元。原定價多少元？","answer":"320","explanation":"0.7x＝0.5x+64，得x＝320。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"0.7*x=0.5*x+64","root":"320","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c2","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"160","misconception":"把七折與一半的差誤算成0.4；正確差率為0.2。"},{"id":"c2","text":"320"},{"id":"c3","text":"640/3","misconception":"錯把七折所省30%當成兩種價格的差率，誤算64÷0.3；差率應為0.7−0.5。"},{"id":"c4","text":"128","misconception":"只以原價一半對應64，忽略七折與五折之差才是64。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q119","typeId":"成本加成折扣","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S09:p1","S16:p1"],"prompt":"零件依成本加六成標價，再打七五折，仍賺180元。成本多少元？","answer":"900","explanation":"1.6×0.75x−x＝180，得x＝900。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"1.6*0.75*x-x=180","root":"900","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c3","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"3600/7","misconception":"將加六成與減二五成直接相減成賺35%；應連乘1.6與0.75。"},{"id":"c2","text":"720","misconception":"只將七五折的25%作為獲利率；正確售價為成本的1.2倍。"},{"id":"c3","text":"900"},{"id":"c4","text":"300","misconception":"只以加價六成計算獲利，漏掉後續七五折造成的售價下降。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q120","typeId":"售價利潤率","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S16:p1"],"prompt":"座椅標價4800元，八五折出售時仍比成本高20%。成本多少元？","answer":"3400","explanation":"0.85×4800＝1.2x，得x＝3400。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"0.85*4800=1.2*x","root":"3400","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c4","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"4000","misconception":"直接把定價除以1.2，漏掉八五折後才是實際售價。"},{"id":"c2","text":"4080","misconception":"這是八五折的實際售價；成本還要除以1.2。"},{"id":"c3","text":"3264","misconception":"把售價減20%當成成本；高20%的基準是成本，應除以1.2。"},{"id":"c4","text":"3400"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q125","typeId":"促銷增購","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S14:p2","S14:p3"],"prompt":"每瓶飲料原價相同；買3瓶九折，買4瓶八折。芮希從3瓶增加到4瓶多付25元。每瓶原價多少元？","answer":"50","explanation":"4×0.8x−3×0.9x＝25，x＝50。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"4*0.8*x-3*0.9*x=25","root":"50","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c1","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"50"},{"id":"c2","text":"250","misconception":"只比較八折與九折的單瓶價差，漏掉購買瓶數從3增加到4。"},{"id":"c3","text":"125/4","misconception":"把三瓶也套用八折，忽略三瓶方案其實是九折。"},{"id":"c4","text":"25","misconception":"把多買的一瓶視為原價25元，未計前後兩方案的折扣。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q128","typeId":"買送平均單價","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S01:p1"],"prompt":"每片能量餅同價，甲方案買5片送1片，乙方案買4片減48元。兩方案每片平均價相同，原價多少元？","answer":"72","explanation":"5x/6＝(4x−48)/4，得x＝72。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"5*x/6=(4*x-48)/4","root":"72","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c4","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"288","misconception":"把乙方案每4片減48元誤算成每片減48元，平均應只減12元。"},{"id":"c2","text":"12","misconception":"只求乙方案每片少付48÷4＝12元，這是折抵額，並非原價。"},{"id":"c3","text":"60","misconception":"這是兩方案共同的每片平均價；原定價還要加回每片優惠12元。"},{"id":"c4","text":"72"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q129","typeId":"大量買送比較","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S01:p5","S14:p6"],"prompt":"兩店單價相同：甲店每2件第二件六折，乙店每4件第四件免費。買20件時，下列哪一組費用比較完全正確？以一件商品的原價為1份價格。","answer":"乙","explanation":"甲付10×1.6＝16件原價，乙付5×3＝15件原價。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c1","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"乙店較低；甲付16件原價，乙付15件原價"},{"id":"c2","text":"兩店相同；甲與乙都付15件原價","misconception":"把甲第二件六折錯當五折；甲實付16件原價，比乙多1件。"},{"id":"c3","text":"甲店較低；甲付12件原價，乙付15件原價","misconception":"把第二件六折套用每一件；甲每兩件應付1+0.6份原價。"},{"id":"c4","text":"甲店較低；甲付16件原價，乙付20件原價","misconception":"漏算乙店每四件有一件免費；20件可免付5件。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q131","typeId":"團體門檻","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S01:p2"],"prompt":"展覽個人票300元；一次買滿25張，每張240元，不限實際入場人數。個人票買幾張會與25張團體票同價？","answer":"20","explanation":"300x＝240×25，x＝20。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"300*x=240*25","root":"20","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c3","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"5","misconception":"只算出團體票與同價個人票的張數差5，未回答個人票20張。"},{"id":"c2","text":"25","misconception":"把團體票張數當成個人票張數；應比較總票價是否同為6000元。"},{"id":"c3","text":"20"},{"id":"c4","text":"100","misconception":"將團體總價6000除以單張差價60；應除以個人票價300才是同價張數。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q132","typeId":"訂閱損益","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S01:p2","S01:p4"],"prompt":"雲端服務月費180元，用量費打六折。宥彬訂閱後比不訂閱省100元，原用量費共多少元？","answer":"700","explanation":"180+0.6x＝x−100，x＝700。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"180+0.6*x=x-100","root":"700","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c4","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"200","misconception":"以180−100再除以0.4，將省下100元的移項方向弄反。"},{"id":"c2","text":"450","misconception":"只計月費180元需由四折省下的金額抵銷，漏掉還要另省100元。"},{"id":"c3","text":"1400/3","misconception":"把用量費六折誤當成省六成；實際用量費只省四成。"},{"id":"c4","text":"700"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"}]}